Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 02:15:05 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 05/16] Harden UnifiedPush network and secret handling

Adapted pinned APIs: check linked-device removal before clearing local credentials; disable redirects for server requests carrying or validating user-provided endpoints; mark copied server parameters and account ID as sensitive and clear clipboard after 60 seconds; provide a no-argument lock-state adapter preserving the pinned Signal predicate.

Target parity: false for these paths; see adaptation manifest and tests-needed notes.
